{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_857d53436936acd1bba85e66c6715e19a72907a4b60e5e8072d02c79fb020be7"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"A /help command lets users ask natural-language questions in a PR comment, and the bot responds with an answer including relevant documentation links."},{"claim_ids":["clm_c09800861b24d85226afdcc851ff75b11e6666b2e9a770c16673083d3d4cd89a"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The feature matrix lists tools including Describe, Review, Improve, Ask, Add Docs, Generate Labels, and Similar Issues, with per-provider support varying (e.g. Ask lacks Gitea support; Similar Issues is GitHub-only)."},{"claim_ids":["clm_c36d6b0874ac3b687127139284eb154224f3a739e2d2e09bb467b08b77774e78"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The /help_docs tool is temporarily disabled since v0.36.1 pending a fix for a credential-exposure issue (issue #2445)."},{"claim_ids":["clm_d4ec3b97e2d827b15a60d5ebb8c0728b5319be39278b5e5ff1b5d31af4c381a1"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"A PR compression strategy converts code diffs into manageable LLM prompts, and the README claims it handles both small and large PRs."}],"claim_ids":["clm_857d53436936acd1bba85e66c6715e19a72907a4b60e5e8072d02c79fb020be7","clm_c09800861b24d85226afdcc851ff75b11e6666b2e9a770c16673083d3d4cd89a","clm_c36d6b0874ac3b687127139284eb154224f3a739e2d2e09bb467b08b77774e78","clm_d4ec3b97e2d827b15a60d5ebb8c0728b5319be39278b5e5ff1b5d31af4c381a1"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:33Z","created_by_operation":"op_8510fd2e1f2e475f889e72a7c094f764","id":"pg_afdb9d3c090e5dfca9b617bc13318879","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/the-pr-agent-pr-agent-docs-docs-index-md-d24b6f36e787-17bc13318879.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_235fd772cca85b48a4cce9c4487ae92b"],"title":"The-PR-Agent/pr-agent/docs/docs/index.md @ d24b6f36e787","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:33Z","updated_by_operation":"op_8510fd2e1f2e475f889e72a7c094f764"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_b009da95f3270b7a6a88b3e347cce921fb4c46bcfe1970fd37c83357acdf06da"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Docker images for version 0.34.2 and later are published under the pragent/pr-agent Docker Hub namespace; older codiumai/pr-agent tags are a frozen archive with no new pushes."}],"claim_ids":["clm_b009da95f3270b7a6a88b3e347cce921fb4c46bcfe1970fd37c83357acdf06da"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:33Z","created_by_operation":"op_8510fd2e1f2e475f889e72a7c094f764","id":"pg_c6930ab1998259f2a4d508317361f2da","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/the-pr-agent-pr-agent-release-notes-md-d24b6f36e787-08317361f2da.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_422360faf2ba59efb3a1efe6930de158"],"title":"The-PR-Agent/pr-agent/RELEASE_NOTES.md @ d24b6f36e787","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:33Z","updated_by_operation":"op_8510fd2e1f2e475f889e72a7c094f764"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[],"claim_ids":[],"created_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:33Z","created_by_operation":"op_8510fd2e1f2e475f889e72a7c094f764","id":"pg_d984685c8cbb57a587265d769ce965fe","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/the-pr-agent-pr-agent-docs-readme-md-d24b6f36e787-5d769ce965fe.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_26a822824c3e5971aee4ec886505ec78"],"title":"The-PR-Agent/pr-agent/docs/README.md @ d24b6f36e787","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:33Z","updated_by_operation":"op_8510fd2e1f2e475f889e72a7c094f764"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_0c0562a4b7ea69a1b4fb73240a06fe56a04021739851f9883684dc7b67566a64"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"When enabled, PR-Agent discovers SKILL.md files under configured paths and injects each skill's name, description, and body into the /review, /improve, /describe, and top-level /ask prompts alongside extra_instructions."},{"claim_ids":["clm_1f642a8b20b4c16442496d356e6c8b9a98f08ce6e6b1c36742583cec868cf31b"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"skills.paths is host-level only: it cannot be set from a repository's .pr_agent.toml, and repo-supplied values are ignored with a warning, to prevent malicious repos from pointing the scan at sensitive host files."},{"claim_ids":["clm_56a80641befb4b89feccbff5575c0bacc1720455b2a25aefdeb61daffc65d8ca"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Agent Skills use a SKILL.md format: a directory with a markdown file whose YAML frontmatter carries name and description, followed by a markdown body of review guidance."},{"claim_ids":["clm_5d2a7d1e95113ebcbe914a5e8a694f4624d007c914b54c5939dc2ebe42da071c"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Because PR-Agent makes single-shot model calls with no tool-use loop, the agent-skills progressive-disclosure model is not implementable; all enabled skill text is loaded into every prompt (bounded by max_skills_tokens), and skills needing script execution or binary assets will not work."}],"claim_ids":["clm_0c0562a4b7ea69a1b4fb73240a06fe56a04021739851f9883684dc7b67566a64","clm_1f642a8b20b4c16442496d356e6c8b9a98f08ce6e6b1c36742583cec868cf31b","clm_56a80641befb4b89feccbff5575c0bacc1720455b2a25aefdeb61daffc65d8ca","clm_5d2a7d1e95113ebcbe914a5e8a694f4624d007c914b54c5939dc2ebe42da071c"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:33Z","created_by_operation":"op_8510fd2e1f2e475f889e72a7c094f764","id":"pg_e241a735f30d528da7dd803d7942be5e","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/the-pr-agent-pr-agent-docs-docs-core-abilities-agent-skills-md-d24b6f3-803d7942be5e.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_37f82d16035951cfb0aa4b38872f0ef3"],"title":"The-PR-Agent/pr-agent/docs/docs/core-abilities/agent_skills.md @ d24b6f36e787","updated_at":"2026-09-14T04:25:33Z","updated_by_operation":"op_8510fd2e1f2e475f889e72a7c094f764"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_0633550c31d74b3f5608a8a5176dd50d01a5f9153f6da5d17259870a9c51ca6d"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: for local verification, run 'PYTHONPATH=. uv run pytest' from the repo root, which discovers the unit-test suite under tests/unittest; e2e tests under tests/e2e_tests need provider credentials and are invoked explicitly."},{"claim_ids":["clm_176b920dc593caafc5c5652ba98c8618da11994aad799ff3cd7704e813ce7c13"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"PR-Agent is an open-source, AI-powered code review agent donated by Qodo to the community; it is distinct from Qodo's primary commercial offering and now lives in the PR-Agent GitHub org with an external maintainer."},{"claim_ids":["clm_1813c09faa7dd08f082d74dceb9c06b2709f075e7186a5162c470f0a7d67c70f"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The product can run as a GitHub Action triggered on pull_request opened/synchronize events, configured via a workflow file that supplies OPENAI_KEY and GITHUB_TOKEN secrets."},{"claim_ids":["clm_3174da958940b56144bf39d271bb895e41d19347e22817c50f622b70d8756acc"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Review behavior is customizable through JSON-based prompting in configuration files such as pr_agent/settings/configuration.toml."},{"claim_ids":["clm_38688547e6d89331173e2c045c5b354fcf7583b13a8876df055b0b65ea2eed51"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Each core tool (/review, /improve, /ask) is described as using a single LLM call, taking roughly 30 seconds at low cost."},{"claim_ids":["clm_b009da95f3270b7a6a88b3e347cce921fb4c46bcfe1970fd37c83357acdf06da"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Docker images for version 0.34.2 and later are published under the pragent/pr-agent Docker Hub namespace; older codiumai/pr-agent tags are a frozen archive with no new pushes."},{"claim_ids":["clm_b75cb5f2ac81680daf71174d139e8913156e4e0bcd44a9b3a7c48fcbce2a1e0e"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"PR-Agent tools can be invoked by commenting commands like /describe, /review, /improve, and /ask on a pull request, or locally via a CLI such as 'pr-agent --pr_url <PR_URL> review'."},{"claim_ids":["clm_c36d6b0874ac3b687127139284eb154224f3a739e2d2e09bb467b08b77774e78"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The /help_docs tool is temporarily disabled since v0.36.1 pending a fix for a credential-exposure issue (issue #2445)."},{"claim_ids":["clm_ccc0fa8621d7ad72179b1753a5fe6ca5b90df03004fe386b49eab1cb7c1fb1e8"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The tool is installable via pip ('pip install pr-agent') and run locally against a repository using an OPENAI_KEY environment variable."},{"claim_ids":["clm_d4ec3b97e2d827b15a60d5ebb8c0728b5319be39278b5e5ff1b5d31af4c381a1"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"A PR compression strategy converts code diffs into manageable LLM prompts, and the README claims it handles both small and large PRs."},{"claim_ids":["clm_f85707b057404a08e08b15c62aaf8f1520fe49896268c867dae993e9e226d554"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Supported AI models include OpenAI GPT, Anthropic Claude, Google Gemini, DeepSeek, Mistral, and any model reachable through LiteLLM (e.g. Azure OpenAI, AWS Bedrock, Vertex AI, Ollama)."}],"claim_ids":["clm_0633550c31d74b3f5608a8a5176dd50d01a5f9153f6da5d17259870a9c51ca6d","clm_176b920dc593caafc5c5652ba98c8618da11994aad799ff3cd7704e813ce7c13","clm_1813c09faa7dd08f082d74dceb9c06b2709f075e7186a5162c470f0a7d67c70f","clm_3174da958940b56144bf39d271bb895e41d19347e22817c50f622b70d8756acc","clm_38688547e6d89331173e2c045c5b354fcf7583b13a8876df055b0b65ea2eed51","clm_b009da95f3270b7a6a88b3e347cce921fb4c46bcfe1970fd37c83357acdf06da","clm_b75cb5f2ac81680daf71174d139e8913156e4e0bcd44a9b3a7c48fcbce2a1e0e","clm_c36d6b0874ac3b687127139284eb154224f3a739e2d2e09bb467b08b77774e78","clm_ccc0fa8621d7ad72179b1753a5fe6ca5b90df03004fe386b49eab1cb7c1fb1e8","clm_d4ec3b97e2d827b15a60d5ebb8c0728b5319be39278b5e5ff1b5d31af4c381a1","clm_f85707b057404a08e08b15c62aaf8f1520fe49896268c867dae993e9e226d554"],"created_at